      "data": {
        "text": "**Implementing Encryption**\n\nI'm making progress on encrypting the payload now that I've set up the helper files. I'm focusing on `encrypt_payload.py`, leveraging Google Cloud KMS for encryption. I'll utilize `get_kms_client` from `security_client.py` and the models from `security_models.py` in this process.\n\n\n",
