      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing Decryption Capabilities**\n\nI've just finished up the `encrypt_payload.py`, `security_client.py`, and `security_models.py` modules. The next crucial step is to build `decrypt_payload.py`. This decryption module will harness Google Cloud KMS, leveraging `security_client.py` and potentially integrating further security utilities, to reverse the encryption process. I anticipate a smoother development of this new module now, given the completed building blocks.\n\n\n**Constructing Decryption Module**\n\nI've finalized the core modules: `encrypt_payload.py`, `security_client.py`, and `security_models.py`. Now, I'm fully focused on creating the `decrypt_payload.py` module. This module will decrypt ciphertext using Google Cloud KMS, leveraging the pre-built `security_client.py` and other modules.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
